        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2009] If the PowerDeliveryReq received has ChargeProgress = \"Start\" and ServiceName = AC or AC_BPT in Table 204 was selected, the next allowed request shall be AC_ChargeLoopReq and the V2G_SECC_Sequence_Timeout is set according to Table 216.",
