        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2012] After receiving the AC_ChargeLoopReq, the SECC shall respond with an AC_ChargeLoopRes with \"ResponseCode = OK\" within V2G_SECC_Msg_Performance_Time according to Table 215. The next allowed request shall be AC_ChargeLoopReq or PowerDeliveryReq and the V2G_SECC_Sequence_Timeout is set according to Table 216.",
            "block_bbox": [
