        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2003] After receiving the DC_CableCheckReq, the SECC shall respond with a DC_CableCheckRes with EVSEProcessing set to \"Ongoing\" within V2G_SECC_Msg_Performance_Time according to Table 217, while the cable check process is still ongoing. The next allowed request shall be DC_CableCheckReq and the V2G_SECC_Sequence_Timeout is set according to Table 217.",
